# Title: Suspicious Download From Direct IP Via Bitsadmin
# ID: 99c840f2-2012-46fd-9141-c761987550ef
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-06-28
# Tags: attack.persistence, attack.execution, attack.stealth, attack.t1197, attack.s0190, attack.t1036.003
# Description: Detects usage of bitsadmin downloading a file using an URL that contains an IP
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((CommandLine CONTAIN "://1" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "://2" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "://3" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "://4" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "://5" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "://6" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "://7" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "://8" OR CommandLine CONTAIN "://9")) AND ((CommandLine CONTAIN " /transfer " OR CommandLine CONTAIN " /create " OR CommandLine CONTAIN " /addfile ")) AND ((Image="*\\bitsadmin.exe") OR (OriginalFileName = "bitsadmin.exe"))) AND NOT ((CommandLine CONTAIN "://7-")))
